{"4119020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doomed Crew", "steam_appid": 4119020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/0020567e65e82c3398eca9d67a26ef9c.avif?t=1783080333\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">YOUR TEAMMATES AREN'T MIMICS</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomed Crew is a chaotic co-op horror experience. You are death row inmates forced to work under a brutal corporation.  Complete given tasks, survive the chaos, get back in one piece, and hope to earn your promised freedom. Best experienced for 2+ players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/28406ce817d7456041e43d759bd00c6a.poster.avif?t=1783080333\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/28406ce817d7456041e43d759bd00c6a.webm?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/28406ce817d7456041e43d759bd00c6a.mp4?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/4e80ed67804489d6771275f7122df4fb.avif?t=1783080333\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">FREEDOM AWAITS</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work matters more than your safety. Team up, starve your rivals, perform gruesome experiments. For freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/1acd9c14f452c2127ea5bcd05b52999f.poster.avif?t=1783080333\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/1acd9c14f452c2127ea5bcd05b52999f.webm?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/1acd9c14f452c2127ea5bcd05b52999f.mp4?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/a373569bfbb759345218b164a61bebc0.avif?t=1783080333\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">YOU ARE SAFE</span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimics aren't the only enemies. Hazards lurk everywhere. Tread carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/506829c1213c97c719c405117a168cd7.poster.avif?t=1783080333\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/506829c1213c97c719c405117a168cd7.webm?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/506829c1213c97c719c405117a168cd7.mp4?t=1783080333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119020/extras/65ba458f80f0d14a1d0ea4afd0b7e9e4.avif?t=1783080333\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragra